2026-07-06 03:30:23,869 [INFO]     strikes over the last FADE_OPT_BARS (3) closed bars. Enter ONLY IF the
2026-07-06 03:30:23,869 [INFO]     trend-side option is NOT decaying AND the opposite-side option IS decaying;
